    [0, 2]: "a"
    [0, 4]: "d"
    [0, 5]: "e"
    [1, 0]: "b"
    [2, 1]: "c"

Graphically this is equivalent to doing

    [    a] concat [  d e  ] = [    a   d e  ]
    [b    ]        [       ]   [b            ]
    [  c  ]                    [  c          ]


